---
import Mark from "../Mark.astro";
---

<section class="connection section-frame" aria-labelledby="connection-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2 id="connection-title">From a USDC balance<br />to an open position.</h2>
    <p>OpenCash sits between your USDC balance and the Hyperliquid order book. Every leg of a bin is its own order, signed by a trade-only key your passkey approves. If one leg fails, the legs that filled are closed.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="connection-graphic" aria-label="USDC balance connects to leveraged markets, thematic bins, and passkey-signed settlement">
    <svg class="connection-lines" viewBox="0 0 1000 360" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M120 80H360L500 180 640 80H880M120 280H360L500 180 640 280H880M500 0V360"></path>
      <path class="flow-line" d="M120 80H360L500 180 640 280H880"></path>
    </svg>
    <div class="connection-center">
      <div class="diamond-stack" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><Mark class="center-mark" /><strong>open</strong><span>CASH</span>
    </div>
    <span class="connection-label top-left">USDC balance</span>
    <span class="connection-label bottom-left">Leveraged markets</span>
    <span class="connection-label top-right">Thematic bins</span>
    <span class="connection-label bottom-right">Passkey-signed calls</span>
  </div>
  <div class="tech-strip"><span>BUILT ON</span><span class="chain-mark"><b>Hyperliquid</b></span><span>Order book</span><span>Passkey signing ↗</span></div>
</section>
